<h2 class="wp-block-heading" id="h-what-to-serve-it-with">What to Serve It With</h2>



<p>This cucumber mint lime CAVA recipe is honestly one of those drinks that just goes with everything. It&rsquo;s light, refreshing, and makes whatever you&rsquo;re eating taste even better. But if I had to pick my favorites, these are the times I always want a glass in my hand:</p>



<ul class="wp-block-list">
<li><strong>With my copycat CAVA bowl:</strong> The ultimate beverage to complete your <a href="https://foolproofliving.com/cava-bowl-recipe/">homemade CAVA bowl</a> experience. You&rsquo;ll feel like you&rsquo;ve brought the whole restaurant experience right into your kitchen.</li>



<li><strong>To accompany your mezze platters:</strong> CAVA&rsquo;s cucumber mint lime drink is the perfect accompaniment to mezze spreads set up with <a href="https://foolproofliving.com/homemade-mediterranean-hummus/">Mediterranean Hummus</a>, <a href="https://foolproofliving.com/baba-ganoush-recipe/">Baba Ghanoush</a>, <a href="https://foolproofliving.com/crazy-feta/">CAVA&rsquo;s famous feta dip</a>, and <a href="https://foolproofliving.com/muhammara-recipe/">Muhammara Dip</a>&nbsp; served with <a href="https://foolproofliving.com/homemade-pita-bread-recipe/">Pita</a> or <a href="https://foolproofliving.com/lavash-bread-recipe/">Lavash</a>.</li>



<li><strong>Next to grilled meats &amp; vegetables:</strong> My go-to move is to make a large pitcher and keep it chilled in a cooler for an easy, refreshing drink that everyone will love. It goes perfectly with many of my Mediterranean-inspired meals like <a href="https://foolproofliving.com/grilled-harissa-chicken/">Harissa Grilled Chicken</a>, <a href="https://foolproofliving.com/grilled-rack-of-lamb/">Rack of Lamb</a>, or <a href="https://foolproofliving.com/beef-kabobs-in-oven/">Beef Babobs</a>.</li>



<li><strong>With fresh salads:</strong> Any of my Mediterranean salads, whether it is <a href="https://foolproofliving.com/greek-cucumber-salad/">Greek Cucumber Salad</a>, <a href="https://foolproofliving.com/cucumber-tomato-mozzarella-salad/">Cucumber Mozzarella Tomato Salad</a>, or Turkish Shepherd Salad.</li>
</ul>


